lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a school cafeteria, 20 students are lining up to buy lunch. Xiao Li says to Xiao Zhang, \"It looks like most people choose hamburgers, a small part choose sandwiches, almost no one buys salad.\" Xiao Zhang counts and finds that only 4 people order sandwiches.\n\n[Question]\nBefore Xiao Zhang counts, how many students does he guess choose hamburgers?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Before Xiao Zhang counts, he guesses that 15 students buy hamburgers.\nB. Before Xiao Zhang counts, he guesses that 10 students buy hamburgers.\nC. Before Xiao Zhang counts, he guesses that 1 student buys a hamburger.\nD. Before Xiao Zhang counts, he guesses that 5 students buy hamburgers.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.009708177072298183,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58ae89aa9dc5a833d5336","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476776374,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:46:16","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4d535e41df5b444d8c49493865a88c55"}